// local data: what is not a variable keeps what was written (the padding
// byte 3, the bit L 2.1 next to b); an ANY takes 10 bytes; P##c points to c
CALL call:Sub
block Sub FC
temp a Int
temp b Bool
temp c Int
temp p Any
temp x Int
L i:171
T LB 3
L LB 3
T MB 0
SET
= L 2.1
A L 2.1
= M 1.0
L i:42
T #x
L LW 16
T MW 2
L P##c
T MD 4
LAR1
L i:5
T W [AR1,P#0.0]
L #c
T MW 8
